                "title": "Cut-off time for UPI Mandate Confirmation",
                "value": "30-June-2026 (upto 5:00 PM) The cut-off time for UPI mandate acceptance is 05:00 PM on last day of IPO bidding. Further bids with confirmed status of mandate amount blocked (RC100) shall be considered as valid applications and hence investors are advised to submit their UPI applications in IPO well in advance to avoid any last minute technical/systemic constraints that may hamper their ability to participate in IPOs by successfully accepting the mandate."
